{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d2374a3c-06b3-8ce9-a3d8-ffe01f3902d6",
  "created_at": "2026-02-06T11:56:49-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Peter Thurston",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:53:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:53:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Tony, yes, good morning. Well, almost afternoon. Peter Thurston here. I need to change my mailing address, and I'd like to go paperless too, if that's possible."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:53:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, we can do that. Which account are we talking about? Do you have a bill in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:53:47-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, I have the paperwork right here. I work in the office at a marina, so I've got everything spread out on the desk. Sure. Okay, so the account number on top is, um, ending in forty-one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:53:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, ending in forty-one. And the name on that one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:54:03-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thurston, Peter Thurston. Oh, but wait. Of course, I have two properties, so there's another bill here too. This one ends in, hold on, fifty-eight. Which one did you want?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:54:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Whichever one you want the changes on. Do you want both updated to the new mailing address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:54:19-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, yes, both. Well, no. Hmm. The forty-one one is the rental, and I want that one to keep going to the old address because, well, no, that's the wrong way around. Sorry. [pause] The fifty-eight is the one I live in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:54:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. So tell me what you want for each. Which one gets the new mailing address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:54:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. Both new address, I think. But the paperless only on the one I live in. Is that okay? Can you do it by account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:54:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, each account has its own settings. So both get the new mailing address, and only the fifty-eight goes paperless. The forty-one keeps paper bills, just mailed to the new place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:54:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, that's it. Sure. Now, this one bill says something about a sewer charge and a water charge, and I thought they were one thing. Why are there two lines?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:55:08-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so the water line is what you use, based on your meter reading. The sewer line is the charge for the wastewater going out, and it's usually figured off the water you used. Same bill, two charges."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:55:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, of course. So the sewer one is, it's, is that on top of the water or inside it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:55:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "On top. They're separate lines that get added together into your total."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:55:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, absolutely. And the other bill, the forty-one, the sewer number is bigger than the water number. Is that a mistake?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:55:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not necessarily. It could be how the rates are set, or an estimated read on that one. I'd want to look at the account to say for sure. I can pull it up while we're talking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:55:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sure. Um, could you put that in writing for me? The explanation, I mean. Just so I have it, because I'm already mixing up which is which."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:55:57-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happy to. I'll note both accounts, send a short explanation of the water and sewer lines, and confirm the address changes. Is the new mailing address the one we'll be sending it to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:56:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, yes. Well, wait, should it go to the old one since the change isn't in yet? Hmm. I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:56:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Send it to the new one. I'm entering the change as we speak, so it'll catch up. Go ahead and give me that address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:56:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Let me find it, I wrote it on, here we go. [pause] Okay, it's a post office box, actually. Is that alright for the water bills?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:56:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A PO box works fine for mailing. Read it to me whenever you're ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:56:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, of course. Thanks, Tony. I think I'm still a little mixed up, but the letter will help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:56:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's what it's for. You'll have it in a few days. Have a good weekend, Peter."
    }
  ],
